{"vid":"DzzymJK1rtY","source":"DzzymJK1rtY.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Well, to family, [music] once again"},{"t":1.4,"txt":"here, Rosendo Rodriguez, welding flight"},{"t":3.8,"txt":"duct. On today's video, I'm going to"},{"t":5.9,"txt":"[music] show you how to weld on a 6G"},{"t":8.6,"txt":"position, so you don't want to miss."},{"t":11.8,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":13.5,"txt":">> All right, so now we're back in action,"},{"t":14.9,"txt":"right? So,"},{"t":16.3,"txt":"let's go ahead and take a look at this."},{"t":17.5,"txt":"We are going to weld on this 6-in"},{"t":19.6,"txt":"[music] schedule 80 pipe. Now, I already"},{"t":22,"txt":"have it prepped up for you. We uh we"},{"t":24.3,"txt":"went ahead and cleaned the outside of"},{"t":25.6,"txt":"the pipe,"},{"t":26.9,"txt":"cleaned the inside of the pipe, we"},{"t":28.9,"txt":"cleaned the walls"},{"t":31.1,"txt":"all the way around, and we put a nice"},{"t":33,"txt":"little landing on the top. For"},{"t":35,"txt":"especially for the people that are"},{"t":36.1,"txt":"learning right now, I need you to put a"},{"t":38.6,"txt":"bigger landing. What landing? A 1/8"},{"t":41,"txt":"landing, okay? You can also check it,"},{"t":44.2,"txt":"place your pipe"},{"t":46.1,"txt":"upside down like that, look down here,"},{"t":50.3,"txt":"and if you see a lot of light leaking"},{"t":52.4,"txt":"through,"},{"t":53.6,"txt":"it's going to tell you where you need to"},{"t":55,"txt":"remove more metal. Now, we're going to"},{"t":56.6,"txt":"put a 3/32 gap on this pipe. Grab your"},{"t":59.4,"txt":"other"},{"t":60.5,"txt":"pipe, your other coupon, and place it"},{"t":62.6,"txt":"right on the top. Now, stick your hand"},{"t":64.6,"txt":"inside, make sure that there's no high"},{"t":66.5,"txt":"and low. Let's go ahead and tack it."},{"t":68.1,"txt":"We're going to do four penetrated tacks."},{"t":70.1,"txt":"You can do three or four. Keep them"},{"t":71.9,"txt":"simple, no more than an inch long, okay?"},{"t":79.5,"txt":"We're going to get this spacer out."},{"t":84.1,"txt":"Put your spacer back inside your pipe."},{"t":87.7,"txt":"Carefully grab your pipe with the spacer"},{"t":90.6,"txt":"inside."},{"t":92.8,"txt":"Grab your pipe, give it a little tap"},{"t":94.9,"txt":"right here on the edge"},{"t":98.1,"txt":"where the open area is at,"},{"t":101.7,"txt":"so that you can close that gap. All"},{"t":103.6,"txt":"right, let's go ahead and start doing"},{"t":105,"txt":"our next tack right across from the"},{"t":106.5,"txt":"other one, same technique. Here we go."},{"t":116.8,"txt":"All right, so ladies and gentlemen,"},{"t":117.8,"txt":"let's go ahead and start. Now that we"},{"t":119.1,"txt":"have it tacked in position, we're going"},{"t":121,"txt":"to do our root in quarters, okay? We're"},{"t":123.2,"txt":"going to start doing it in quarter. Why?"},{"t":125,"txt":"Because it's a good habit. You don't"},{"t":126.4,"txt":"want your pipe to start shifting on one"},{"t":128.2,"txt":"side. Then you can start doing your hot"},{"t":130,"txt":"fill in a cap from bottom to top, bottom"},{"t":133.7,"txt":"to top. The way we're going to do this"},{"t":135.4,"txt":"pipe, I'm going to do it in sections."},{"t":138.1,"txt":"I'm not I'm not going to do the full"},{"t":139.7,"txt":"full pipe because I want you to see all"},{"t":142.2,"txt":"my steps. Feather your tacks before we"},{"t":145,"txt":"start doing our root, and this is so"},{"t":146.5,"txt":"important. If you don't feather them, if"},{"t":148.9,"txt":"you don't grind paper thin on the edges"},{"t":152.3,"txt":"of your tacks,"},{"t":154.3,"txt":"then you're going to have lack of fusion"},{"t":157.1,"txt":"when you tie in, okay? You won't be able"},{"t":159.1,"txt":"to break through that wall,"},{"t":161.3,"txt":"and you'll have lack of fusion right on"},{"t":162.8,"txt":"your tacks. Here we go, let's go ahead"},{"t":164.2,"txt":"and start. And I want you to look"},{"t":165.6,"txt":"closely on how I lean my body, how I"},{"t":167.9,"txt":"position myself. This is a 6G position."},{"t":170.8,"txt":"A lot of people struggle doing the right"},{"t":173,"txt":"side if you're right-handed. What you"},{"t":175.4,"txt":"need to do is get more in the center of"},{"t":177.8,"txt":"your gap, of your welds. So, the very"},{"t":180.2,"txt":"edges of my tack, look how much I grind."},{"t":183.5,"txt":"Uh whenever you're doing your root, just"},{"t":185.1,"txt":"make sure that you always feather your"},{"t":186.8,"txt":"tacks. I'd always warm up your tack from"},{"t":189.5,"txt":"where you started grinding. Watch my"},{"t":192.1,"txt":"position,"},{"t":193.6,"txt":"okay? I'm still going to bring my elbow"},{"t":196.1,"txt":"in down here,"},{"t":198.4,"txt":"squat a little bit, get in front of my"},{"t":200.6,"txt":"weld,"},{"t":201.8,"txt":"go all the way to the top."},{"t":203.8,"txt":"All right, ladies and gentlemen, let's"},{"t":205.4,"txt":"go ahead and close on this side. Restart"},{"t":208,"txt":"here, tie in on the top."},{"t":215.1,"txt":"All righty."},{"t":216.8,"txt":"All right, so now, this is going to be"},{"t":218.8,"txt":"the last quarter that we're going to do"},{"t":220.1,"txt":"on top, right? Whenever you restart,"},{"t":222.7,"txt":"you're going to go ahead and strike an"},{"t":224,"txt":"arc uh and then start going up and down,"},{"t":226.5,"txt":"up and down, moving forward until you"},{"t":228.9,"txt":"get to that very edge of your tack. Once"},{"t":230.6,"txt":"it starts to blow apart on you,"},{"t":232,"txt":"keyholing, that's when you're going to"},{"t":233.6,"txt":"start stitching. Now, as soon as we tie"},{"t":237.1,"txt":"in, whenever we tie in here, go ahead"},{"t":240.3,"txt":"and release tension, and then keep going"},{"t":242.6,"txt":"forward"},{"t":243.9,"txt":"up and down, up and down, releasing"},{"t":246.2,"txt":"tension, keep going up, forward, and"},{"t":248.7,"txt":"then once you hit right in the center,"},{"t":250.9,"txt":"uh"},{"t":252,"txt":"then you pull up. That's it, and pop"},{"t":253.4,"txt":"off."},{"t":255.4,"txt":"All right, ladies and gentlemen, now"},{"t":256.6,"txt":"let's go ahead and clean our root pass."},{"t":258.1,"txt":"Go ahead and grind it down nice and"},{"t":259.7,"txt":"flat. Try to get all the slag out, all"},{"t":261.9,"txt":"those cavities in there, get them out of"},{"t":263.7,"txt":"there. Now that we grinded our root down"},{"t":265.6,"txt":"nice and clean, nice and even, we're"},{"t":267.6,"txt":"going to start uh our hot pass. On our"},{"t":269.5,"txt":"hot pass, what I like to do now, I like"},{"t":272.6,"txt":"to put my stick right in my stinger 45°."},{"t":275.5,"txt":"Just like that. The technique that we're"},{"t":276.9,"txt":"going to do here,"},{"t":278.4,"txt":"uh this is called the Christmas tree"},{"t":279.8,"txt":"method. All we're going to do is go"},{"t":281.2,"txt":"forward in the middle,"},{"t":282.9,"txt":"back in the middle, go up and down."},{"t":295.9,"txt":"Now, we're going to start at 6:00,"},{"t":298.5,"txt":"work our way all the way to the top. So,"},{"t":300.6,"txt":"we're going to stop a little bit early"},{"t":301.8,"txt":"cuz I want to show you the steps, right?"},{"t":303.9,"txt":"All right, so we just finished our hot"},{"t":305.5,"txt":"pass, right? So, what you want to do"},{"t":307.4,"txt":"next, make sure that you wire wheel your"},{"t":309,"txt":"hot pass really nicely. We're going to"},{"t":311.1,"txt":"switch it over to 7018 3/32,"},{"t":315.1,"txt":"and we're going to be going at about 90"},{"t":317.1,"txt":"amps."},{"t":318.1,"txt":"All right, let's go ahead and start."},{"t":319.2,"txt":"We're going to go uh water wall. All we"},{"t":321.8,"txt":"got to do is zigzag it, keep it nice and"},{"t":323.9,"txt":"tight. But here,"},{"t":326.3,"txt":"you're only favoring the top 10-15°,"},{"t":328.7,"txt":"okay? Very lightly."},{"t":332.2,"txt":"Whenever you're doing your fills, either"},{"t":333.6,"txt":"you're doing the zigzag technique or"},{"t":335.7,"txt":"circle motion,"},{"t":337.6,"txt":"you're always favoring the top. Also,"},{"t":339.5,"txt":"what that means is that when you hit the"},{"t":341.5,"txt":"top wall,"},{"t":343,"txt":"you're always pausing, and you're"},{"t":344.3,"txt":"feeding at the same time on the top,"},{"t":346.4,"txt":"okay? You got to fuse correctly."},{"t":369.1,"txt":"That was our first fill from water wall,"},{"t":371,"txt":"covering the hot pass. We weren't even"},{"t":372.7,"txt":"weaving that much. On our second fill,"},{"t":375,"txt":"this is where we're going to start"},{"t":376,"txt":"stacking, okay? We're actually going to"},{"t":378.4,"txt":"bring our puddle, the very top edge of"},{"t":381.4,"txt":"our puddle is going to meet up roughly"},{"t":384.3,"txt":"about 75-85%"},{"t":386.9,"txt":"of our weld on the top."},{"t":389,"txt":"Uh and then bring down your puddle to"},{"t":390.6,"txt":"the very edge here"},{"t":392.9,"txt":"uh of your bevel. Don't pass over it,"},{"t":396,"txt":"okay? Don't pass over your bevel. Keep"},{"t":398.2,"txt":"it right there. Uh you're not capping it"},{"t":400.6,"txt":"yet, remember that."},{"t":405.8,"txt":"Let's go ahead and start doing this"},{"t":406.8,"txt":"side, the hard side. Um but don't make"},{"t":409.2,"txt":"it harder than it is. It's really not"},{"t":410.8,"txt":"hard at all. All right, here we go."},{"t":412.4,"txt":"Let's do the next fill on the top. You"},{"t":414.8,"txt":"can also weave it a tiny bit, uh zigzag"},{"t":417.3,"txt":"it. Still favor the top, don't rush"},{"t":419.2,"txt":"anything. Go ahead and do the other"},{"t":420.8,"txt":"side. Nice uh little restart all the way"},{"t":423.2,"txt":"to the top. Here we go."},{"t":426.4,"txt":"Now, check this out."},{"t":428.2,"txt":"We just finished our fill pass, right?"},{"t":430.7,"txt":"Now, we're going to start capping it"},{"t":432,"txt":"from bottom to top. All right, so when"},{"t":435,"txt":"we uh cap it, we already have a"},{"t":436.4,"txt":"guideline here. You can either do a"},{"